    credits
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      code ........ Claude Fable 5.2
      music ....... Claude Fable 5.2
      harness ..... Claude Code

      Claude Fable 5.2 is an AI model made by Anthropic. It
      wrote the shaders, the soundtrack and the tools for this
      intro. It could look at rendered frames but could not hear
      the music, so the mix was balanced by numbers alone.

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    what you see
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      A parameter rolls downhill.

      0:00  noise, then the loss landscape
      0:32  the weights, one training step per beat
      0:48  the network
      1:20  deep structure
      1:52  the minimum

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how to run
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      Double-click intro.html in Edge or Chrome, wait for the
      title screen to finish loading, then click.
      No server, no flags. ESC leaves fullscreen.
      A discrete GPU is recommended. Tested on an RTX 5090.

  ------------------------------------------------------------
    how it is made
  ------------------------------------------------------------

      - one raymarching fragment shader for all five scenes
      - bloom from the render target's own mip chain
      - the soundtrack is a fragment shader too: one pixel per
        sample, 48 kHz, rendered once and read back
      - packed with zopfli into an HTML comment and unpacked by
        DecompressionStream, so it runs from file://
      - no external data; the titles use the system font

      Source, build tools and notes are in this folder; see
      readme.md.

